# Never upload these to Cloudflare.
#
# The assets directory is the repo root, so without this file wrangler ships the
# git database and the working files along with the site. Cloudflare's _redirects
# has no 404 action, so exclusion — not a redirect — is what keeps them private.
.git
.gitignore
.assetsignore
.wrangler
__pycache__
_source-images
rebuild-images.py
hubspot-provision.mjs
README.md
HUBSPOT-SETUP.md
wrangler.jsonc
